	"data": "<!-- scanner: tagged active/ongoing but not updated in 122d — review -->\n\nInfrastructure Visualization\n\n\"Be able to see the wires and the walls — with augmented reality. The wires and the pipes and just all the foundational infrastructure of the house. Then expand that outwards to be the town, the city.\"\n— cithoreal, 2026-04-14\n\nCore Concept\n\nA layered, spatial visualization system that makes invisible infrastructure visible — at every scale from household to global. The same design philosophy…",
